        }
      }
    },
    "Battery %lld%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池 %lld%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery health": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池健康"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery health and cycles, and how they changed over three months.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池健康状况和循环次数，以及过去三个月的变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery health over time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池健康度变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before the Mac sleeps, Chargectl reconnects wall power if it had cut it to discharge. Turn this on to keep discharging while asleep. macOS holds the limit itself during sleep; where it can’t hold yours, wall power stays cut while asleep so the battery only drifts down a little.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 Chargectl 曾为放电而切断外接电源，它会在 Mac 睡眠前重新接通电源。开启此选项可在睡眠期间继续放电。睡眠期间，macOS 会自行维持充电上限；如果无法维持你设定的上限，外接电源会在睡眠期间保持断开，让电量仅小幅下降。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caches": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
