    "Chargectl": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl Service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl checks GitHub for a new release every few hours. Each download is checked against its published checksum and code signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 每隔几小时检查一次 GitHub 是否有新版本。每次下载都会对照已发布的校验和与代码签名进行验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl hasn’t run into a problem since the helper started at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自辅助程序于 %@ 启动以来，Chargectl 未遇到问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl hasn’t run into a problem.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 未遇到问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl is back to your limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 已恢复至充电上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl lives in your menu bar. Click the ring any time to see your battery and change the limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 位于菜单栏中。随时点按圆环即可查看电池状态并更改上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl manages charging with the rules on this page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 根据此页面的规则管理充电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl needs to install its helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 需要安装辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl needs to remove its helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 需要移除辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl needs to replace its old helper.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 需要替换旧的辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl reads the battery once a second. This takes a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 每秒读取一次电池信息，请稍候。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl restarts into the new version. It is downloaded from GitHub and checked against its published checksum and code signature first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 会重新启动并运行新版本。更新会先从 GitHub 下载，并对照已发布的校验和与代码签名进行验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl runs the battery down to %@%%, charges it to 100%%, rests for an hour, then returns to your limit. Keep the charger connected. This takes several hours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 会将电量降至 %@%%，再充至 100%%，静置一小时，然后恢复充电上限。请保持充电器连接。整个过程需要数小时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl saves a summary of each day. Health changes slowly; the chart says the most after a few weeks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 每天保存一份摘要。健康度变化缓慢，积累数周后图表更有参考价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl stopped charging; your Mac runs on the charger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargectl 已停止充电；Mac 正使用充电器供电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargectl tells you about new versions; you install them here.": {
