        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除辅助程序：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper is installed but doesn’t answer. Installing it again usually fixes this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助服务已安装但没有响应。重新安装通常可以解决此问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper is not running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台服务未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper is still version %@. Install it again to update it to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序仍为 %@ 版本。请重新安装以更新至 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper records a point every minute. The charts appear with the second point, so this page fills in on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序每分钟记录一个数据点。记录第二个数据点后图表便会出现，此页面会自动填充数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper runs as root. After installing, turn on Chargectl in System Settings › Login Items. Removing it reconnects wall power.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助服务以 root 身份运行。安装后，请在系统设置 › 登录项中启用 Chargectl。移除服务后将恢复外接电源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper runs as root. Installing it asks for your password once; updates keep it running. Removing it reconnects wall power.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助服务以 root 身份运行。安装时需要输入一次密码；更新时服务会继续运行。移除服务后将恢复外接电源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper stopped answering, so charging is not controlled. Open Chargectl to install it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序无响应，充电控制已停止。请打开 Chargectl 重新安装辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper stopped. Install it again to restart charge control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序已停止。请重新安装以恢复充电控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper stops, cutting wall power has no effect, the battery is too warm, or the charger can’t keep up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序停止运行、切断外接电源未生效、电池过热，或充电器供电不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper writes a line when the battery or a setting changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池状态或设置发生变化时，辅助程序会写入一条日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list reloads every 5 seconds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表每 5 秒刷新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next full charge by a set time, and when charging starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一次定时充满的时间及充电开始时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trend appears as the helper records one summary a day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序每天记录一份摘要后将显示趋势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
