            "value": "然后恢复至 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This %lld W charger can't keep up: the battery is running down while plugged in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 %lld W 充电器功率不足：接通电源时电池电量仍在下降。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac exposes no wall-power key, so charging cannot be controlled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
