        }
      }
    },
    "Install the helper to record history": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装辅助程序以记录历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper records charge, temperature and power once a minute, even while Chargectl is closed. macOS asks for your password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序每分钟记录一次电量、温度和功率，即使 Chargectl 已关闭也会继续记录。macOS 会要求您输入一次密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the helper to see its log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装辅助程序以查看日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper logs what the battery does and what Chargectl changes, even while the app is closed. macOS asks for your password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序记录电池的状态和 Chargectl 所做的更改，即使应用已关闭也会继续记录。macOS 会要求您输入一次密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cutting wall power has no effect: the battery keeps charging. A macOS or firmware update may have changed how charging is controlled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开电源适配器未生效：电池仍在充电。macOS 或固件更新可能更改了充电控制方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper could not be copied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法复制辅助程序。"
